# MOFs-derived MnOx@C nanosheets for peroxymonosulfate activation: Synergistic effect and mechanism

## MOFs-derived $\mathtt{M n O_{x}@C}$ nanosheets for peroxymonosulfate activation: Synergistic effect and mechanism
