addition and form peroxide adducts (Eq. (22)). After deprotonation and intramolecular nucleophilic displacement (Eqs. (23)– (24)), the derived dioxirane adduct could be attacked by PMS to generate $^10_{2}$ (Eq. (25)) [76].
